%% IA-01 Screen structure: one scrolling screen, fixed order of regions
flowchart TB
  H["R1 Header<br/>app name · permit"] --> WK["R2 Week banner<br/>week number · odd/even"]
  WK --> CAR["R3 My car<br/>(only when a car is saved)"]
  CAR --> Q["R4 Question<br/>street · number · location ·<br/>start time · until time"]
  Q --> A["R5 Answer<br/>permit → park now? → until when → why → details"]
  A --> ALT["R6 Alternatives<br/>longest stays nearby"]
  ALT --> CTX["R7 Context<br/>map · legend"]
  CTX --> F["R8 Footer<br/>rules summary · data date · disclaimer"]
